      "id": 455797,
      "username": "Adam.Niescierowicz",
      "name": "Adam Niescierowicz",
      "created_at": "2025-01-30T09:29:45.387Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Only in the UI there is date not datetime, python has datetime.</p><aside class=\"onebox githubblob\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/9a34c4c1ec1e921cef0270095398ec3c0b00cf28/erpnext/projects/doctype/task/task.py#L45C3-L45C17\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/9a34c4c1ec1e921cef0270095398ec3c0b00cf28/erpnext/projects/doctype/task/task.py#L45C3-L45C17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <h4><a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/9a34c4c1ec1e921cef0270095398ec3c0b00cf28/erpnext/projects/doctype/task/task.py#L45C3-L45C17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">frappe/erpnext/blob/9a34c4c1ec1e921cef0270095398ec3c0b00cf28/erpnext/projects/doctype/task/task.py#L45C3-L45C17</a></h4>\n\n\n\n    <pre class=\"onebox\"><code class=\"lang-py\">\n      <ol class=\"start lines\" start=\"45\" style=\"counter-reset: li-counter 44 ;\">\n          <li>\t\texp_start_date: DF.Datetime | None</li>\n      </ol>\n    </code></pre>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>If you want to change date to datetime in ‘customize form’ there is somekind of validation that refuse the change.</p>",
